# AudioWRT-owned packages that compile/link upstream source code.
#
# These are allowed to traverse the OpenWrt SDK build dependency graph because
# they need headers/libraries/tooling to produce their AudioWRT APK. Every other
# package in config/package-build-targets is package-only and must be built with
# NO_DEPS=1 so OpenWrt runtime dependencies remain official release binaries.

